{"v":4,"catch":"成為 THUNDER FOX 反恐組織的一員，\n像閃電一樣打擊殘暴的恐怖分子！","desc":"《THUNDER FOX》是TAITO於1990年推出的動作遊戲。\n成為「THUNDER FOX」反恐隊伍的一員，加入打擊恐怖分子的戰鬥。\n使用飛踢、翻筋斗攻擊以及旋翼機、水上摩托車等多種獨特車輛完成各種任務！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-01-30","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3e39df275376207fb7f238f867728b823816317264f646f2241d38adf9dc16fc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c59e1c051cb2102cc5e6a9ae7b3a6194b47ec92c938d619b0a26633a138c6572.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b97b0242bddabbf45cdf2c14df8a0eb2d1105bc83917f68ac6e50a5aa0a75e87.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/250f106eb4a26e4a23756f064c3f04851512d9fdf0ce6669266179772018c290.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c331c157a7ffc3ec9f56c9ad75d527011a759265fdcb2e44c9d22cb6fdfd9637.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/af5d58f3d19bb30fda66a346b79818b2711e12d607afff0bbdd1e799ade4b9ee.jpg"],"titleId":"0100bcd01ea68000","dlc":[]}